    {
      "id": "claim_59bb6d8e08dd498994a8a2e2fed52430",
      "statement": "BillCollector has two coexisting operating modes in one repository and one SQLite file (apps/db/bc.db): the cron-launched batch engine (BillCollector.sh -> apps/BillCollector.py -> apps/BillCollectorServices_pw.py with headless Chromium and legacy per-run tables) and the NiceGUI daemon (python3 -m billcollector serve/run with UI, scheduler, orchestrator, and isolated runner subprocesses); both share the data layer, vault client, recipe files, and helpers.",
