      "id": "claim_638d507f3106427eb91b454596e3189a",
      "statement": "The batch wrapper BillCollector.sh takes an exclusive non-blocking flock on apps/.bc.lock for the whole docker run (rejecting a double start with exit 1), requires a readable apps/.env, and docker-runs python3 ./BillCollector.py <ini> [debug] in billcollector:latest; the batch entry point exits 1 immediately on vault-preflight failure, isolates a failed service/user pair (the remaining pairs continue), and exits 1 at the end if any pair failed, 0 otherwise.",
