      "id": "claim_70e426c5b7b94944aee05c0e6cd8fbe1",
      "statement": "The local regression harness (tests/run_regression.py plus tests/mock_portal and tests/scenarios.py) drives the production scraping engine against a local mock portal and checks the engine return value, the DB rows, the downloaded files, and the exit semantics; exit codes are 0 all expectations matched, 1 a deviation, 2 mock portal could not be started, 3 a real run holds the run lock, 4 the --vault preflight failed; --vault is an opt-in end-to-end mode that requires a provisioned Vaultwarden while the default mode is fully self-contained.",
